        {
          "_id": "5ba3ab13aa5a8a0039024bf1",
          "fullText": "There is 1 reserved space for your car on site (only one!) behind the building.\nThere is no dividing line that clearly apportions one from the other.\nYou must park close to the right-hand side of the space.\nParking in the other space or in the center could lead to partial or complete loss of your security deposit.\nPlease be respectful of the space and our neighbors.\nPlease also be careful and drive with caution as this is a residential neighborhood with many children.\n\nDirections to On-site parking:\nFrom the street address of 1471 Girard St NW:\nDrive (or walk) down Girard St NW toward 15th St NW.\nTurn right onto 15th St NW.\nContinue down 15th st for approximately 115 ft (35 meters) and then turn right into the alley behind the building.\n\nIf you need space for an additional car or prefer to house your car in an indoor garage we recommend going to 11 Dupont Circle NW ($25/night) or 1145 19th St NW ($21/night)",
          "value": "There is 1 reserved space for your car on site (only one!) behind the building.\nThere is no dividing...",
          "fieldId": "5b180bca47b570002af67404"
        },
