        },
        {
          "_id": "5ba3ab13aa5a8a0039024bec",
          "value": "This property has a washing machine and dryer located inside the apartment for your convenience.\nIt is in the closet directly before the downstairs bedroom and across the hall from the smaller hallways bathroom.\nDetergent and softener should be available in this closet.\nPlease try not to use these machines during quiet hours (8pm to 8am) as they can create some noise and disturb other guests.",
          "fieldId": "5b243881a3861b02660d9b26"
        },
        {
          "_id": "5ba3ab13aa5a8a0039024beb",
          "value": "You may have packages delivered to this address, however...\nWe cannot allow you access to our mailboxes, therefore please do not have any very small packages or letters shipped by USPS. If an item ends up in our mailbox we are not responsible for giving you access to it.\nPlease also note that we cannot guarantee the safety or shipping time of whatever item you have delivered. We will do our best to help in all cases but cannot make any guarantees. If a package or lost item is found and needs to be returned to you then you will be responsible for paying any related shipping and handling fees.",
          "fieldId": "5b2438d44df5c2001fabfc05"
        },
        {
          "_id": "5ba3ab13aa5a8a0039024bea",
          "value": "https://goo.gl/maps/oobqS2RvpS32",
          "fieldId": "5b033afac863bf0024bd7f20"
        },
        {
          "_id": "5ba3ab13aa5a8a0039024be9",
          "value": "We cannot allow you to store any luggage on the property outside of your reservation time period.\nHowever we can recommend some local bag storage locations that you can utilize at your convenience.\nUse the links provided to choose from the location that best suits your needs, the cost is roughly $6/day/item for stored luggage. The available vendors are Vertoe, StoreMe and BagBnB.\nVertoe\u2019s rates are among the cheapest in DC. Bags cost $5.95/day (online price) and they have deals for groups. See their pricing page for more information.  To get 5% off your storage fee, use the coupon code vertoeshare.",
          "fieldId": "5b033b855751bf001f6711f2"
        },
        {
          "_id": "5ba3ab13aa5a8a0039024be8",
          "value": "Remember to take any of your belongings with you when you exit.\nMake sure that the door to the roof deck is closed.\nShut the door and press the Schlage symbol at the top of the touchscreen to lock it.\nPlease come back and stay with us again, safe travels!",
          "fieldId": "5b033afac863bf0024bd7f1f"
        },
        {
          "_id": "5ba3ab13aa5a8a0039024be7",
          "value": "Nearest Metro Station - Columbia Heights\nThe nearest metro station is Columbia Heights Station, it connects directly to both the Yellow and Green Lines.\n\nIt is a 0.372 mile walk from 1471 Girard St NW.\n\nTo get there, walk East down Girard ST NW toward 14th ST NW (against the flow of traffic).\n\nTurn left onto 14th ST NW and walk North toward Irving St NW.\n\nThere is an entrance to this metro station on the Southwest and Northeast corners of the intersection between Irving St NW and 14 St NW.\n\nThe closest one to you should be the Southwest corner of that intersection (on your left).",
          "fieldId": "5b1fc63e59414f0020df6a33"
        },
